{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ShipCrafter is a naval sandbox combat simulator. Build you ship, unlock new parts, and defeat increasingly powerful foes !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge adversaries in the campaign and liberate europe, or battle your own creations in the custom battle mode, and try to come up with the most efficient and original design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854870/extras/09d9b41e405bcccc9aa114f16879e943.avif?t=1761993857\" width=1600 height=332 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realtime physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We want to make a game with accurate physics. As such we implemented a realtime buoyancy system based on weight and submerged volume. The ship density and center of mass is displayed in editor, allowing to fine tune your ship and even make submarines using ballasts !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weaponery physics were particularly cared for as well, with fully simulated shell trajectories considering air pressure, changes in density through the atmosphere, and the influence of speed on shells drag value. Penetration calculations are calculated based on armor thickness, angle of incidence, bounce probability, and shell speed and mass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854870/extras/daf179ae3b5ff6f59f784a9b6821449c.poster.avif?t=1761993857\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854870/extras/daf179ae3b5ff6f59f784a9b6821449c.webm?t=1761993857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854870/extras/daf179ae3b5ff6f59f784a9b6821449c.mp4?t=1761993857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x1m sized blocks for the highest visual and physical accuracy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color mode in editor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realtime buoyancy simulation even considering ocean waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various armor thicknesses and accurate penetration calculation based on speed, mass and angle of incidence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic ballistic trajectories even considering changes in the air pressure with altitude. Speeds and distances are however reduced to increase the nervosity of combats (in reality it would take more than a minute to hit a target at 20km).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable ballasts for submarine designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics based damages instead of healthbars. Turrets and engines will also lose performance if hit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather system and day cycles, including changes in ocean waves amplitude and rain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign with more than 50 missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 20 different ships to defeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom battle editor, including weather, time of day selection, and bots vs bots naval battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manual and automatic control mode for weaponery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realtime fluid simulation (experimental).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit your ship in first person view.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop supported.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854870/extras/5df8b2333526179a5da894e8b42e608b.avif?t=1761993857\" width=1560 height=324 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam workshop support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game (including the demo) already supports the steam workshop ! You can share your creations with the community and download other people's ships this way !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854870/extras/545751ce4cae4e7ba08e1eeac9b61032.avif?t=1761993857\" width=1560 height=324 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coming soon</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Airplanes including catapults and flight decks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More diverse weaponery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854870/extras/7f72ad156982fb33c9132beaa801a1ba.avif?t=1761993857\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854870/extras_big/7f72ad156982fb33c9132beaa801a1ba.avif?t=1761993857 width=800 height=167 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Follow the development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the discord to discuss of the futur of the game, propose new features, post your creations or simply talk about WWII ships and connect with the community !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854870/extras/316afffdff8bc38d608c921438fc75c5.avif?t=1761993857\" width=1560 height=324 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Getting bigger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854870/130d665b6e4971707361862e59d868326384eaa2.jpg"},{"name":"Serious machine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854870/fc7d70fa4bda6a57bcfb07de2a1d58dec43b27e3.jpg"},{"name":"Behemoth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854870/47597c162cbeeed9f18e7501dd48f01c76da63e2.jpg"},{"name":"Pacifist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854870/516904235dd872bd65af4f913d5c10975c801ebe.jpg"},{"name":"The largest of all","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854870/8f3a57b458440a826b0257d1269c68c4a2170742.jpg"},{"name":"Metal skin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854870/e8ddba380daba8fc1c2f7707dbee92fc400ca8e3.jpg"},{"name":"3 digits","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854870/027fe6d69d48af0603d1438e937b4a4bca0de1ee.jpg"},{"name":"Loaded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854870/9568c99082456758dcf45ffe6df9f85f735b708f.jpg"},{"name":"Taking off","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854870/9570bea2b1aa3de2ea27dad9ca62ae077798ec8d.jpg"},{"name":"Ruler of the seas","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854870/f6463bd623c75d81b383798188520208289db7ad.jpg"}],"total":17},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854870?t=1761993857","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854870/b5163a8eddf8914884f3030b074ae368c0e63e37/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761993857","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854870/6d0e66d56b50b7b3cd35bfbdce4464b33b770aaa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761993857","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854870/6d0e66d56b50b7b3cd35bfbdce4464b33b770aaa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761993857","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3861000,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ShipCrafter is a naval sandbox combat simulator. Build you ship, unlock new parts, and defeat increasingly powerful foes !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge adversaries in the campaign and liberate europe, or battle your own creations in the custom battle mode, and try to come up with the most efficient and original design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854870/extras/09d9b41e405bcccc9aa114f16879e943.avif?t=1761993857\" width=1600 height=332 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realtime physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We want to make a game with accurate physics. As such we implemented a realtime buoyancy system based on weight and submerged volume. The ship density and center of mass is displayed in editor, allowing to fine tune your ship and even make submarines using ballasts !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weaponery physics were particularly cared for as well, with fully simulated shell trajectories considering air pressure, changes in density through the atmosphere, and the influence of speed on shells drag value. Penetration calculations are calculated based on armor thickness, angle of incidence, bounce probability, and shell speed and mass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854870/extras/daf179ae3b5ff6f59f784a9b6821449c.poster.avif?t=1761993857\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854870/extras/daf179ae3b5ff6f59f784a9b6821449c.webm?t=1761993857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854870/extras/daf179ae3b5ff6f59f784a9b6821449c.mp4?t=1761993857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x1m sized blocks for the highest visual and physical accuracy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color mode in editor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realtime buoyancy simulation even considering ocean waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various armor thicknesses and accurate penetration calculation based on speed, mass and angle of incidence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic ballistic trajectories even considering changes in the air pressure with altitude. Speeds and distances are however reduced to increase the nervosity of combats (in reality it would take more than a minute to hit a target at 20km).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable ballasts for submarine designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics based damages instead of healthbars. Turrets and engines will also lose performance if hit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather system and day cycles, including changes in ocean waves amplitude and rain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign with more than 50 missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 20 different ships to defeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom battle editor, including weather, time of day selection, and bots vs bots naval battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manual and automatic control mode for weaponery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realtime fluid simulation (experimental).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit your ship in first person view.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop supported.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854870/extras/5df8b2333526179a5da894e8b42e608b.avif?t=1761993857\" width=1560 height=324 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam workshop support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game (including the demo) already supports the steam workshop ! You can share your creations with the community and download other people's ships this way !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854870/extras/545751ce4cae4e7ba08e1eeac9b61032.avif?t=1761993857\" width=1560 height=324 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coming soon</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Airplanes including catapults and flight decks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More diverse weaponery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854870/extras/7f72ad156982fb33c9132beaa801a1ba.avif?t=1761993857\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854870/extras_big/7f72ad156982fb33c9132beaa801a1ba.avif?t=1761993857 width=800 height=167 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Follow the development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the discord to discuss of the futur of the game, propose new features, post your creations or simply talk about WWII ships and connect with the community !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854870/extras/316afffdff8bc38d608c921438fc75c5.avif?t=1761993857\" width=1560 height=324 /></span></p>","developers":["Myrmecoman"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854870/07c4e456c1efdc3b9c9bceec66d3f95cf0c84893/header.jpg?t=1761993857","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 cores - 3GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 8 cores - 3.5GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX2060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3854870/2010893457/5a57c635f8911ccadd0e64e9883b8657edac9497/1759160056/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759161573","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3854870/2010893457/5a57c635f8911ccadd0e64e9883b8657edac9497/1759160056/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759161573","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3854870/2010893457/5a57c635f8911ccadd0e64e9883b8657edac9497/1759160056/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759161573","id":257171356,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171356/movie480.mp4?t=17591615